                "description": "The Belmont Knob with Oval Rosette is great for any traditionally decorated home. The half round knob shape is a classic when paired with the oval rosette, for a traditional door knobset that will blend seamlessly into historic homes. The Traditional Half Round Belmont Knob with Oval Rose is available in a wide array of lovely finishes. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for every interior door in your home from the bedroom, to the bathroom, and even the hall closet.\r\n\r\n",
